496683402", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75411996_673505500016735_2170965674423752804_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bZIeCTfnPBQQ7kNvwGbA-Dx&_nc_oc=Ado3fzd7YYbAeYIyGX8RTOemYd4z5A-zhuV2U_JM_J_GKWOlS4llMIrfc2viL4TH14k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEIKtHJxH0EbkCClbjvu9pvjVfjXqOvW38WWgOkfLmw5g&oe=6A7883EB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "vr battle of battleship logo 2560 x 1440 210408 0.png", "id": "187457906371403", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75324644_187457909704736_8884903440668078259_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=d0seOEDf9WwQ7kNvwEwDA0S&_nc_oc=AdqIGirhQ_uC5QMtm-hlsa6cyJ9H4uXWX1XfZpa3QYYeW6-9jlOGzYV6XGU4ZCQGY_0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHImjcg4dPoYglfLmbMnJURu1swxDDAzdC_1Sj6es5Xdg&oe=6A7867B1"}, "display_name": "VR Battle of Battleship", "keywords": [], "long_description": "1. Basic Operation:\n- You can start the battle by firing the main guns of the battleship.\n- The following modern weapons are added to increase the tension of the game:\n    - Your battleship has CIWS Beam for defense\n    - Enemy battleship has Anti-ship missiles\n\n2. The Physical Law Modification:\nTo realize the short-time and amazing spectacle battle of huge battleships, some of the physical laws in this Real-Time Simulation World are carefully modified.\n\n3. Conclusion:\nWe believe that the amazing spectacle battle of the huge battleship in VR world is established by the\nunique modification of the physical laws in this application.\nPlease enjoy this VR real-time simulation of battle of battleship.\n\nNull City Realtime Simulation, Development Team", "short_description": "\u201cVR Battle of Battleship\u201d is a Real-Time Simulation Game of the one-on-one fight of the Ultimate Huge Battleships; IOWA-class and Yamato-class in VR world.\nFrom the beginning of this application, yo